  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/master/.github/README-assets/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p>\n<h1>实体纹理特性</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>关于</h1>\n<p>ETF 是一款适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 的模组，添加了众多<em>实体纹理特性</em>，包括实体和玩家皮肤特性！</p>\n<p>ETF 主要支持 OptiFine 格式，作为 OptiFine 的替代模组之一，但拥有更多特性和选项！</p>\n<p>如果你想在 Fabric 上体验更多 OptiFine 的特性，可以查看 LambdaAurora 制作的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252foptifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这份列表</a>，<strong>或者</strong>使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252ffabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized 整合包</a>，其中包含了<strong>所有</strong>与 OptiFine 功能对等的模组！</p>\n<h1>特性</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>支持使用 OptiFine 格式自定义和随机实体纹理，包含更多属性！<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/RANDOM_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>支持使用 OptiFine 格式制作自发光/发光实体纹理，<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/EMISSIVE_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>简化的闪烁生物格式。<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README.md#-blinking-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>玩家皮肤特性，包括闪烁、自发光纹理等更多内容！<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/SKIN_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>兼容性</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>OptiFine 的随机/自定义或自发光实体资源包</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体模型特性 (EMF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">dorianpb 的旧版 CEM 模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris 着色器</a>（支持情况因着色器而异）</li>\n<li>模组添加的实体（仅当模组作者使用原版渲染代码渲染其生物时）</li>\n<li>以及更多</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>设置与配置</h1>\n<p>可以在游戏内通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>、资源包界面的设置按钮，或编辑位于 <code>config/entity_texture_features.json</code> 下的配置文件来更改设置。</p>\n<h1>模组支持</h1>\n<p>只要使用常规的原版渲染方式，本模组应与任何添加实体的模组兼容。</p>\n<p>任何在自定义 GUI 中显示实体的模组，都可以通过将 <code>entity.getblockstate</code> 设置为 <code>null</code> 或类型为 <code>VOID_AIR</code> 来强制使用默认纹理。也可以通过将显示生物的 UUID 设置为 <code>UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes((\"GENERIC\").getBytes())</code> 来实现相同效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>更新日志</h1>\n<p>你可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/common/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>查看更新日志。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>需要帮助或有疑问？</h1>\n<p>你可以通过我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>推荐</em>）联系，或在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交 Issue。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>主机合作伙伴优惠</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"图片\"></a></p>",
